==Trivia==
*It seems there may be a power struggle of sorts within the Bun Bun family, as the term ''Oiesōdō'' (お家騒動) in [[Trouble at the Mansion]]'s Japanese name, Bukeyashiki Oiesōdō (武家屋敷お家騒動, "Family Trouble at the Samurai Mansion"), literally means "family trouble" or "domestic trouble", but could also refer to an internal squabble (over headship rights) in a daimyo family during the Edo period of Japan.
*Li'l Bun Bun's favorite word being "love" is a reference to [[Teacher Bun Bun]]'s irrational power of love.

